  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Paisley, Armoury Tattoo stands as a beacon of artistic excellence in the tattoo world, offering bespoke dotwork tattoos since 2002. This family-owned studio, spanning two generations of skilled artists, is renowned for its award-winning custom designs and unparalleled dedication to the craft. Step into their welcoming space on 10 New Street to experience a fusion of tradition and innovation, etched into every unique piece they create.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Paisley, Scotland, United Kingdom\n\nAward Winning Custom Tattoo since 2002\nFamily owned by 2 generations of tattoo artists\n📍10 New Street-Paisley, Scotland\n📩 armourytattoo@hotmail.com",
